<h2>Options</h2>
<p>
    This visualization has three options for Thanos Sort: <b>Realistic</b>, <b>Instant</b>, and <b>Gaps</b>.
    <ol>
        <li>
            <b>Realistic</b>: When removing elements from an array, 
            everything after the element must be moved to fill the empty space.
            This setting shows this process in the visualization.
        </li>
        <li>
            <b>Instant</b>: This setting skips the shifting process described in <b>Realistic</b>,
            making the removal happen instantly in the visualization.
        </li>
        <li>
            <b>Gaps</b>: This setting also skips the shifting process and also leaves the empty space
            created by the removed element. This makes it easier to see where elements have been removed.
        </li>
    </ol>
</p>